      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the select_voice.py file that lists or selects a voice for a target locale, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. The task specifies that the provider must be identifiable in the code. I will use the Amazon Polly service, which is a text-to-speech service that turns text into lifelike speech. I will import the boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with the Polly service. The boto3 library will be used to list available voices and select a voice for a specific locale. </thinking>\n",
